  "notes": "DRAFT by Claude (s348) for Ben to move in the Map Workshop. ZION = a wild-west GOLD TOWN in red-rock mesa country. Unlike the other worlds the town is ONE LONG MAIN STREET (east-west) of false-front buildings with boardwalks, crossed by CREST STREET at the round CREST PAD + fountain (the square). WEST: Main Street becomes the HILL PATH (parked monster trucks, Hilltop Overlook) → the switchback HILL RUN → HILL RUN, UPPER → the truck gang base. EAST: the cobblestone TRUCK ROAD (Truck Shop, Bull Barn, staging yard) → CREST RISE north to the MONSTER ARENA. NORTH: Castle Path over the DRY MOAT to Zada's castle + Barracks. SOUTH: the winding GOLD RIVER (2 bridges, 3 panning spots, Survay Office, oil derrick in the SW corner) and the Zion Space Dock. Red mesas out in the open (off-path freedom). EVERY BUILDING IS UNIQUE: see each building's \"outside\" note. Every building has a roof sign + eye-level door sign. NPC keys are draft until surface_zion.html comes in.",
